rilla</a> enforces the Masquerade.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Opposes:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/vampire-the-masquerade/world-of-darkness/second-inquisition\" class=\"entity-link\">Second Inquisition</a>\n            — Hunters threaten to break the Masquerade.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/vampire-the-masquerade\" class=\"entity-link\">Vampire: The Masquerade</a>\n            — <a href=\"/vampire-the-masquerade\" class=\"entity-link\">Vampire: The Masquerade</a> is connected to The Masquerade through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/vampire-the-masquerade/white-wolf\" class=\"entity-link\">White Wolf</a>\n            — <a href=\"/vampire-the-masquerade/white-wolf\" class=\"entity-link\">White Wolf</a> is connected to The Masquerade through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/vampire-the-masquerade/paradox-interactive\" class=\"entity-link\">Paradox Interactive</a>\n            — <a href=\"/vampire-the-masquerade/paradox-interactive\" class=\"entity-link\">Paradox Interactive</a> is connected to The Masquerade through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/vampire-the-masquerade/mark-rein-hagen\" class=\"entity-link\">Mark Rein·Hagen</a>\n            — <a href=\"/vampire-the-masquerade/mark-rein-hagen\" class=\"entity-link\">Mark Rein·Hagen</a> is connected to The Masquerade through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/vampire-the-masquerade/kindred\" class=\"entity-link\">Kindred</a>\n            — <a href=\"/vampire-the-masquerade/kindred\" class=\"entity-link\">Kindred</a> is connected to The Masquerade through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connec